<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post116115244004491163..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Cultists, Counterfeiters, and Cop-Outs</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>7</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116132825878000708</id><published>2006-10-20T01:10:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-20T01:10:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Rick,Read http://www.loosechangeguide.com/LooseCha...</title><content type='html'>Rick,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Read &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.loosechangeguide.com/LooseChangeGuide.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.loosechangeguide.com/LooseChangeGuide.html&lt;/A&gt; to shed some light on the bullcrap the 9/11 theorists are pushing out.  Or, if you want a more childish, concise, and profanity-filled article, read: &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.thebestpageintheuniverse.net/c.cgi?u=911_morons&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.thebestpageintheuniverse.net/c.cgi?u=911_morons&lt;/A&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116132825878000708'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116132825878000708'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161328200000#c116132825878000708' title=''/><author><name>Bantam</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16201680998271303137</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1226589948"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2006 at 1:10 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116131742223239560</id><published>2006-10-19T22:10:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-19T22:10:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This is a transcript of the actual speech given by...</title><content type='html'>This is a transcript of the actual speech given by Congressional candidate Paul Smith.&lt;BR/&gt; Today, October 17, 2006, a date that will live in infamy - the Constitution of the United States of America was suddenly and deliberately attacked by the Empire of Darkness through  the signing of the Military Commissions Act.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The People were appeasing that force and, at the solicitation of American patriots, was still in conversation with the government and it&#39;s emporer looking forward to maintenance of peace in our land.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Indeed, six weeks after the towers were pulled, the Patriot Act was thrust upon Congress which, even while ignoring it&#39;s collective oath to preserve and protect the Constitution, was decieved into setting the first shackle of our liberty in place&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It will be recorded that the time from October 26, 2001 to October 17 2006 makes it obvious that the attack was deliberately planned many years ago. During the intervening time, the powers of Darkness have deliberately sought to deceive the people by false statements and expressions of hope for continued peace.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Satan has, therefore, undertaken a surprise offensive extending throughout the society. The facts of thirty years of abortion speak for themselves. The people of the United States have already formed their opinions and well understand the implications to the very life and safety of our nation. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The attack today on the Constitution has caused severe damage to American liberty. Very many American lives have already been sacrificed.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt; No matter how long it may take us to overcome this premeditated invasion, the American Chrisitans in their (read Christ&#39;s) righteousness should perservere to the end having already won an absolute victory in Christ.&lt;BR/&gt;With absolute confidence in His resurrection power, let us go boldy forth into the world for our Lord&#39;s sake.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116131742223239560'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116131742223239560'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161317400000#c116131742223239560' title=''/><author><name>TravisTHeadcase</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13233913623475062985</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-949434069"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 19, 2006 at 10:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116129823435361883</id><published>2006-10-19T16:50:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-19T16:50:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>kishnevi,i believe your logic is flawed.  to you i...</title><content type='html'>kishnevi,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;i believe your logic is flawed.  to you it may be certain that there was no govt involvement, but to me, i think there was.  there was simply too much info available before the attacks that it was going to happen.  stock options, cancelled flights, chartered flights vs commercial flights, and the fact that an air force exercise was running the same day....you&#39;ve got to be in a state of denial not to smell something rotten in this one.  and then there&#39;s the secrecy the administration stills clings to.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;and to think that too many people would have to be involved so the thought of the govt pulling this off is unlikely therefore there is no govt involvement?  well, &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;...you fail to fathom how evil these folks are.  ...or how evil they have yet to become.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;as for the demolition, if there was one, if you were the company, or employee of that company that placed charges on that building (let&#39;s say it did happen), would YOU come forward and say that you helped placed charges on that building?  heck no!  not only would you get lynched, but you would also have the govt prosecute you (to cover themselves), and then you&#39;d get fired.  heck, you&#39;d be dead before that would happen.  it&#39;s a self-regulating crime.  if everyone kepts his mouth shut then everyone stays out of trouble.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116129823435361883'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116129823435361883'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161298200000#c116129823435361883' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 19, 2006 at 4:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116129008814910265</id><published>2006-10-19T14:34:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-19T14:34:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&#39;s pretty certain that there was no government p...</title><content type='html'>It&#39;s pretty certain that there was no government plot to bring down the Towers.  The alleged plotters would only require something less drastic (say one plane into the Pentagon) to achieve their aims, and the Rube Goldbergian variations on the 9-11 claims require too many people and too many chances for exposure to have ever seriously been considered.  If you want to commit mass murder on that scale, you want as few people as possible--not scores or hundreds, as would be necessary if the controlled demolition and other elaborations were true.  Also, if the government plot did exist, it would (given the identities of those who have controlled the government since January 2001) have included manufactured evidence showing clear traces of Iraqi involvement.  Such evidence does not exist, which means this current government was not the source of 9-11.&lt;BR/&gt;It&#39;s quite possible that some low level FBI/CIA informer was involved, or even instigated the plan; it&#39;s almost certain that after 9-11 anyone who had any acts of incompetency to hide would have tried their best to hide them.  In that sense there is a government coverup.  But nothing more.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116129008814910265'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116129008814910265'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161290040000#c116129008814910265' title=''/><author><name>kishnevi</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01437400043049608843</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1619920610"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 19, 2006 at 2:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116125069370119837</id><published>2006-10-19T03:38:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-19T03:38:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>will,i&#39;m surprised they didn&#39;t invite ann coulter....</title><content type='html'>will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;i&#39;m surprised they didn&#39;t invite ann coulter.  seems she&#39;s all for military tribunals.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.wnd.com/news/article.asp?ARTICLE_ID=52512&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;she&#39;s of the opionion that since it&#39;s been done before, why be against it now?....as if what took place in the past was the right and proper course of action.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;there&#39;s something about apologists that is baffling.  they have no foresight in that they do not see the &quot;2nd and 3rd order effects of an action/decision&quot;.  &quot;it must be ok because I SUPPORT IT!&quot; seems to be their mantra.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116125069370119837'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116125069370119837'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161250680000#c116125069370119837' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 19, 2006 at 3:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116118298410432060</id><published>2006-10-18T08:49:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-18T08:49:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,I don&#39;t know much about Bill Sali, but if he ...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I don&#39;t know much about Bill Sali, but if he is the proverbial apple polisher as you are indicating here, then Bill Sali, if elected, will not need to go very far to find himself a mentor.  I am referring to Rep. John Doolittle, the regime&#39;s representstive here in my little corner of California.  About the only thing Doolittle has done of value for us is to keep the Auburn Dam project alive.  Otherwise he has been beholden not to us, his constituents, but rather to The Money and its ambassadors like Jack Abramoff and all, without so much as the courtesy of a reach-around.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In the Primary here last spring, the only credible candidate to run against &quot;30 peices of silver&quot; Doolittle was a guy by the name of Mike Holmes, a city councilman in Auburn, CA.  I am aquainted with Mike and know his brother Jim Holmes, a Placer County Supervisor, quite well.  Echoing back to to a previous blog, besides Dr. Paul, the only other Republicans I&#39;ll vote for are the Brothers Holmes.  Will, thank you for making me aware of the  gangrene that has permeated the Republican Party.  From now on, I am going to identify myself as a Constitutionalist and educate myself  above and beyond my current level of understanding as to what this document requires of our Government and those that would call themselves our leaders.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116118298410432060'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116118298410432060'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161182940000#c116118298410432060' title=''/><author><name>Captain Kirk</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04563942938766163570</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1941374111"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 18, 2006 at 8:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116117917531919565</id><published>2006-10-18T07:46:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-18T07:46:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>will,i believe you discredit the awesome mike iron...</title><content type='html'>will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;i believe you discredit the awesome mike ironsides when you compare him to...that senator....MEDIC!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;great piece.  nice to know that the prez actually sits down with his &quot;spokespeople&quot; and tells them what to say.  jeesh.  i didn&#39;t know it was that bad...&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;gold&lt;BR/&gt;silver&lt;BR/&gt;lead&lt;BR/&gt;:-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116117917531919565'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116115244004491163/comments/default/116117917531919565'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html?showComment=1161179160000#c116117917531919565' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/cultists-counterfeiters-and-cop-outs.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116115244004491163' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116115244004491163' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 18, 2006 at 7:46 AM"/></entry></feed>